WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.680
Europa, and the two ships on their way.

00:03.380 --> 00:08.375
Under that ice is twice as much water as every ocean on Earth put together.

00:08.825 --> 00:23.743
Europa Clipper reaches Jupiter in April 2030 to fly past here 49 times and ask whether anything could live down there; Europe's JUICE arrives in 2031 and ends up circling Ganymede.
